# 引用本软件的 CITATION.cff（https://citation-file-format.github.io/）
# `version` 与 pyproject.toml 的 project.version 保持同步。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  如果本仓库对你的研究有帮助，请引用本软件及其基于的 SMELT 论文。
title: SMELT-ISR
subtitle: SMELT with Independent Second Round Routing (Delayed-Merge)
type: software
authors:
  - alias: qwe12345678
    name: SMELT-ISR Contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - sparse mixture-of-experts
  - MoE routing
  - transformer
  - reproducibility
  - delayed merge
abstract: >-
  Delayed-merge routing experiments on the SMELT sparse MoE Transformer.
  The repository provides controlled-variable comparisons, multi-seed
  statistics with power analysis and equivalence testing, preregistration,
  environment/run auditing, and artifact manifests for reproducible
  research on sparse MoE routing mechanisms.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: SMELT (arXiv:2609.01343)
  url: "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.01343v1"
  notes: >-
    本实现的口径基线；head 几何与专家中间维等未披露量按仓库
    docs/paper_reproduction.md 的固定规则推导。
